# Learn the PAROL6 build as cards

Every milestone page on this wiki is also a card in the site's learn deck. A card holds the page's plain summary, its terms, its sources and the milestones it builds on. The deck runs M1 to M7 in build order.

## Read the deck

- Browse the [milestones](/lore/milestones) in order. Each page lists the milestone it builds on.
- Agents connected to the site's MCP server can read the deck with the `learnDeck` and `learnCard` tools. Both are read-only and store nothing.

## What a card cites

Each card points at the same official sources as its page. A claim the sources do not cover stays marked **needs_source** on the page and on the card.

